eld low. The spec describes the pump as a low-side switch with no pull-up.\", \"evidence\": [{\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(node (ref \\\"R5\\\") (pin \\\"2\\\") (pintype \\\"passive\\\"))\"}, {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"46\\\") (name \\\"/G_{PUMP}\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\")\"}, {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"R5 /GPUMP +3V3 10k\"}, {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"R12 0 /GATO 10k\"}], \"impact\": \"During boot or GPIO float the main circulation pump can switch on unintentionally, which is a safety and reliability concern for the nutrient loop.\", \"confidence\": 0.4}]}",
